+/*
+ * SWEET PROCCPU (patch 0186, under sweetperf=1): cumulative user+system CPU time of backboardd and SpringBoard.
+ * Lookup: proc_iterate(PROC_ALLPROCLIST | PROC_NOWAITTRANS) (bsd/kern/kern_proc.c:3583): snapshots the pids under proc_list_lock, drops it, then calls the callout
+ * per process with a proc reference held (released on PROC_RETURNED), no filterfn (it would run under proc_list_lock). NOWAITTRANS so the Mali completion
+ * thread (this one) never sleeps in proc_transwait for a process mid-exec (bsd/sys/proc_internal.h:988; used by bsd/dev/dtrace/dtrace.c:17543).
+ * Name: p_comm via proc_name_address (kern_proc.c:1390; MAXCOMLEN 16 holds both names). CPU: task_info(proc_task(p), TASK_ABSOLUTETIME_INFO) (osfmk/kern/task.c:5072;
